4%A4%E7%89%A9%E9%A9%BB%E5%9C%BA%E5%8D%8F%E6%88%98%EF%BC%8C%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E5%85%B7%E6%9C%89%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E6%80%A7%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1655539386282\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/06/01/50494840/f87dee8d6f9d00e9c9b3d265e2071321_476089909765715881.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>雷之律者</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提升输出和循环能力，爆发状态下可使用武器技能并立刻衔接终结技，拓展了角色的玩法和机制。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/06/18/50494840/64fbdb25052e7621f20e65919ef67b21_5949063532530199429.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">大幅提升角色对克制敌人的全伤害，使用武器主动后可回复能量，释放必杀技后重置武器冷却，主要针对克制敌人，是功能性较强的通用雷伤武器。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">雷之律者使用时拥有额外机制。入场时提供额外律者能量，武器技能命中时附加【鸣神】状态，且爆发状态下可释放武器技能并触发极限闪避技能，之后可立即释放终结技；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">两段必杀技期间均附带时停效果，大幅提高雷之律者对各类加成的利用率，契合其输出模式的同时提高了角色的可玩性，美中不足的则是提高了必杀技的冷却时间；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">一定操作下可将飞龙作为召唤物驻场协战，补充伤害的同时具有一定的功能性。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/06/18/50494840/64fbdb25052e7621f20e65919ef67b21_5949063532530199429.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
